[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:08.58]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:13.52]left a single note and went on their way
[00:18.74]I never got their name until the credits
[00:22.98]now it plays here every single day
[00:29.72]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:33.08]One note at a time
[00:39.24]from people passing through
[00:42.70]a name beside a line
[00:49.72]and part of it is you
[00:52.60]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
